---
layout: base.njk
title: "공지사항"
description: "도단의 새로운 소식과 공지사항을 확인하세요."
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
tags: []
---
<section class="hero" style="padding-bottom:0;">
  <div class="hero__wrap" style="grid-template-columns:1fr; padding-bottom:56px;">
    <div class="hero__copy">
      <span class="hero__eyebrow">Notice</span>
      <h1>공지사항</h1>
      <p class="hero__desc">파트너십, 운영 안내 등 도단의 새로운 소식을 전해드립니다.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="board-head">
      <div class="section-head left" style="margin-bottom:0;">
        <span class="kicker">News</span>
        <h2>새로운 소식</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="board-list">
      {% for post in collections.notices %}
      <a class="board-item" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <span class="board-item__badge">{{ post.data.category or "공지" }}</span>
        <span class="board-item__title">{{ post.data.title }}{% if post.data.summary %}<span class="excerpt">{{ post.data.summary }}</span>{% endif %}</span>
        <span class="board-item__date">{{ post.date | koDate }}</span>
      </a>
      {% else %}
      <div class="board-empty">등록된 공지사항이 없습니다.</div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
